    <div class="container">
        <h1>Finite State Machine</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">The Choreography of Change: How Discrete States Enable Reliable Completion</p>

        <div class="fsm-diagram">
            <!-- Row 1: Initial states -->
            <div class="state-row">
                <div class="state initial">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 1</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Initialize</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">session.json</span>
                </div>

                <div class="transition-arrow">
                    <span class="event-label">docs_uploaded</span>
                    <div class="arrow-line"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="state processing">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 2</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Document Discovery</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">documents.json</span>
                </div>

                <div class="transition-arrow">
                    <span class="event-label">indexed</span>
                    <div class="arrow-line"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="state processing">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 3</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Requirements Mapping</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">mapping.json</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vertical connector -->
            <div class="vertical-connector">
                <span class="event-label">mapped</span>
                <div class="arrow-down"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 2: Middle states -->
            <div class="state-row">
                <div class="state processing">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 6</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Cross-Validation</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">validation.json</span>
                </div>

                <div class="transition-arrow">
                    <span class="event-label">extracted</span>
                    <div class="arrow-line" style="transform: scaleX(-1);"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="state processing">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 5</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Evidence Extraction</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">evidence.json</span>
                </div>

                <div class="transition-arrow">
                    <span class="event-label">checked</span>
                    <div class="arrow-line" style="transform: scaleX(-1);"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="state validation">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 4</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Completeness Check</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">completeness.json</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vertical connector -->
            <div class="vertical-connector">
                <span class="event-label">validated</span>
                <div class="arrow-down"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 3: Final states -->
            <div class="state-row">
                <div class="state validation">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 7</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Report Generation</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">report.md</span>
                </div>

                <div class="transition-arrow">
                    <span class="event-label">generated</span>
                    <div class="arrow-line"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="state final">
                    <span class="state-number">Stage 8</span>
                    <span class="state-name">Human Review</span>
                    <span class="state-artifact">decision.json</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Legend -->
        <div class="legend">
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-dot initial"></div>
                <span class="legend-text">Initialization</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-dot processing"></div>
                <span class="legend-text">Processing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-dot validation"></div>
                <span class="legend-text">Validation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-dot final"></div>
                <span class="legend-text">Human Decision</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Concepts -->
        <div class="concepts">
            <div class="concept-card">
                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">1</span>
                    One State at a Time
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Like a seed that is either germinating or sprouting but never both,
                    the system occupies exactly one state at any moment. This constraint
                    creates clarity about what work is being done.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="concept-card">
                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">2</span>
                    Events Trigger Transitions
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    State changes happen only in response to specific events. The system
                    cannot drift into a new state—it must be triggered. This creates
                    predictable, auditable progression.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="concept-card">
                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">3</span>
                    Artifacts at Each Stage
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Every state produces verifiable outputs. These artifacts prove work
                    was completed and provide the inputs for subsequent stages.
                    No phantom progress—only documented results.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="concept-card">
                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">4</span>
                    Boundaries Enable Intervention
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Stage transitions are pause points where human intelligence can
                    intervene—correcting classifications, adding documents, adjusting
                    parameters before committing to the next phase.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote -->
        <div class="quote-section">
            <p class="quote-text">
                "The finite state machine embodies ecological wisdom: rather than building AI
                that tries to be everything, we build AI that knows exactly what it is doing
                at each moment—systems that know their role in a larger choreography and
                execute that role with precision and reliability."
            </p>
            <p class="quote-attribution">— Registry Assistant Architecture</p>
        </div>
    </div>
