                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Discovery</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Mapping</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Extraction</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Validation</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Report</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Review</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <span class="path-stage">Complete</span>
            </div>

            <div class="mario-metaphor">
                <div class="mario-title">The Mario Metaphor</div>
                <div class="mario-text">
                    "Each review session progresses through eight carefully designed stages, a journey I likened to <em>playing Mario, trying to reach level eight</em>. You cannot skip from World 1-1 to World 8-4. You must progress through each level, accumulating power-ups and capabilities along the way. The linear progression is not a limitation; it is the fundamental architecture that makes the system reliable, auditable, and trustworthy."
