                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">1</span>
                    One State at a Time
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Like a seed that is either germinating or sprouting but never both,
                    the system occupies exactly one state at any moment. This constraint
                    creates clarity about what work is being done.
