                    <span class="concept-icon">3</span>
                    Artifacts at Each Stage
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Every state produces verifiable outputs. These artifacts prove work
                    was completed and provide the inputs for subsequent stages.
                    No phantom progress—only documented results.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="concept-card">
                <div class="concept-title">
                    <span class="concept-icon">4</span>
                    Boundaries Enable Intervention
                </div>
                <p class="concept-text">
                    Stage transitions are pause points where human intelligence can
                    intervene—correcting classifications, adding documents, adjusting
                    parameters before committing to the next phase.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote -->
