    <title>MCP Architecture: The Three Primitives</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1628 0%, #1a2f4a 50%, #0d3b2d 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: #e8f4f0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #7dd3c0;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(125, 211, 192, 0.3);
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #a0c4b8;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .architecture-diagram {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        /* Client-Host Section */
        .client-host-layer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .client-box {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1e3a5f 0%, #162d4a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #3d7a9e;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 25px 35px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            position: relative;
        }

        .client-box h3 {
            color: #7dc3eb;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .client-box p {
            color: #9abfdb;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Connection Lines */
        .connection-layer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 80px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .protocol-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2d5a4a 0%, #1f4a3a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #4a9a7a;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #7dd3c0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(74, 154, 122, 0.3);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .connection-line {
            position: absolute;
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #3d7a9e, #4a9a7a);
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        /* MCP Server Section */
        .server-layer {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f2922 0%, #1a3d32 100%);
            border: 3px solid #3a8a6a;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgba(58, 138, 106, 0.2);
        }

        .server-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .server-header h2 {
            color: #7dd3c0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .server-header p {
            color: #6ab89e;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* The Three Primitives */
        .primitives-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .primitive-card {
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .primitive-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .primitive-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
        }

        /* Resources */
        .resources {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a3d52 0%, #0f2a3d 100%);
            border: 2px solid #4a8aaa;
        }

        .resources::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4a8aaa, #7ab8d8);
        }

        .resources .icon {
            color: #7ab8d8;
        }

        /* Tools */
        .tools {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #3d3a1a 0%, #2a280f 100%);
            border: 2px solid #aa9a4a;
        }

        .tools::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #aa9a4a, #d8c87a);
        }

        .tools .icon {
            color: #d8c87a;
        }

        /* Prompts */
        .prompts {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2d1a3d 0%, #1f0f2a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #8a4aaa;
        }

        .prompts::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8a4aaa, #b87ad8);
        }

        .prompts .icon {
            color: #b87ad8;
        }

        .primitive-card .icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .primitive-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #e8f4f0;
        }

        .primitive-card .description {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #b8d4c8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .primitive-card .examples {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .primitive-card .examples h4 {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #8ab8a0;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .primitive-card .examples ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .primitive-card .examples li {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #a0c4b8;
            padding: 4px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .primitive-card .examples li::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .resources .examples li::before {
            background: #4a8aaa;
        }

        .tools .examples li::before {
            background: #aa9a4a;
        }

        .prompts .examples li::before {
            background: #8a4aaa;
        }

        /* Hierarchy Section */
        .hierarchy-section {
            margin-top: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hierarchy-section h2 {
            color: #7dd3c0;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hierarchy-diagram {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 20px;
            height: 200px;
        }

        .hierarchy-bar {
            width: 120px;
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hierarchy-bar:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .hierarchy-bar span {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
        }

        .hierarchy-bar.resources-bar {
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #4a8aaa 0%, #2a5a7a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #7ab8d8;
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .hierarchy-bar.tools-bar {
            height: 130px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #aa9a4a 0%, #7a6a2a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #d8c87a;
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .hierarchy-bar.prompts-bar {
            height: 180px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #8a4aaa 0%, #5a2a7a 100%);
            border: 2px solid #b87ad8;
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .hierarchy-label {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #8ab8a0;
        }

        /* Mycelium Metaphor */
        .metaphor-section {
            margin-top: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a1a15 0%, #152a22 100%);
            border: 2px solid #2a5a4a;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 35px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .metaphor-section h2 {
            color: #7dd3c0;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .metaphor-section p {
            color: #a0c4b8;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .metaphor-section .highlight {
            color: #7dd3c0;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6a8a7a;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #7dd3c0;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }

            .primitives-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hierarchy-diagram {
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .hierarchy-bar {
                width: 90px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Model Context Protocol Architecture</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">The connective tissue enabling planetary-scale AI intelligence</p>

        <div class="architecture-diagram">
            <!-- Client Layer -->
            <div class="client-host-layer">
                <div class="client-box">
                    <h3>AI Application</h3>
                    <p>Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or any MCP client</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Connection -->
            <div class="connection-layer">
                <div class="connection-line"></div>
                <div class="protocol-badge">JSON-RPC over MCP</div>
            </div>

            <!-- MCP Server Layer -->
            <div class="server-layer">
                <div class="server-header">
                    <h2>MCP Server</h2>
                    <p>Exposes capabilities through three universal primitives</p>
                </div>

                <div class="primitives-container">
                    <!-- Resources -->
                    <div class="primitive-card resources">
                        <div class="icon">&#128218;</div>
                        <h3>Resources</h3>
                        <p class="description">
                            <strong>The Data Layer.</strong> Resources expose information that AI systems can read and use as context. They are application-controlled, meaning the client explicitly requests and manages access.
                        </p>
                        <div class="examples">
                            <h4>Examples</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>File contents and documents</li>
                                <li>Database records</li>
                                <li>Configuration values</li>
                                <li>Session state</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tools -->
                    <div class="primitive-card tools">
                        <div class="icon">&#128295;</div>
                        <h3>Tools</h3>
                        <p class="description">
                            <strong>The Action Layer.</strong> Tools are executable functions that AI can invoke to perform actions. They are model-controlled, meaning the AI decides when to call them based on user intent.
                        </p>
                        <div class="examples">
                            <h4>Examples</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Load and analyze datasets</li>
                                <li>Execute API calls</li>
                                <li>Modify system state</li>
                                <li>Generate visualizations</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Prompts -->
                    <div class="primitive-card prompts">
                        <div class="icon">&#10024;</div>
                        <h3>Prompts</h3>
                        <p class="description">
                            <strong>The Orchestration Layer.</strong> Prompts are reusable templates that compose tools into workflows. They encode expertise and guide AI through complex multi-step processes.
                        </p>
                        <div class="examples">
                            <h4>Examples</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Guided review workflows</li>
                                <li>Analysis pipelines</li>
                                <li>Discovery sequences</li>
                                <li>Best-practice patterns</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hierarchy Section -->
        <div class="hierarchy-section">
            <h2>The Hierarchy of Capability</h2>
            <div class="hierarchy-diagram">
                <div class="hierarchy-bar resources-bar">
                    <span>Data</span>
                    <div class="hierarchy-label">Resources</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hierarchy-bar tools-bar">
                    <span>Actions</span>
                    <div class="hierarchy-label">Tools</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hierarchy-bar prompts-bar">
                    <span>Workflows</span>
                    <div class="hierarchy-label">Prompts</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mycelium Metaphor -->
        <div class="metaphor-section">
            <h2>The Mycelial Network Metaphor</h2>
            <p>
                Just as <span class="highlight">mycorrhizal networks</span> beneath a forest floor connect trees
                without central coordination, MCP enables any AI system to connect to any data source or tool
                through a universal protocol. Each server maintains <span class="highlight">autonomy</span> over
                its own capabilities while becoming transparently available to others. The result:
                <span class="highlight">emergent intelligence</span> at planetary scale, where the whole
                becomes greater than the sum of its parts.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>RegenAI Week 4 | <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io">Model Context Protocol</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
